  "ingredients": [
    "24 ounce salmon fillets with skin",
    "2 tablespoon pesto",
    "1/2 cup mayonnaise",
    "1/2 cup parmesan cheese (grated or shredded)",
    "16 ounce spinach",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "4 tablespoon walnuts (crumbled)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all ingredients. Pre-heat oven to 400F and grease a baking sheet or casserole dish that will fit the salmon.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pesto-salmon-with-wilted-greens/#wprm-recipe-54741-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Pesto-Salmon-with-Wilted-Greens-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season the skin-side of the salmon with salt and pepper, then lay it on the baking sheet or in the casserole dish. Season the top with salt and pepper as well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pesto-salmon-with-wilted-greens/#wprm-recipe-54741-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Pesto-Salmon-with-Wilted-Greens-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together the topping by combining pesto, mayonnaise, and parmesan cheese in a small bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pesto-salmon-with-wilted-greens/#wprm-recipe-54741-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Pesto-Salmon-with-Wilted-Greens-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread the pesto mixture over the top of the salmon fillet(s) making sure to distribute evenly. Place in the oven and bake on the middle rack for 20-30 minutes or until salmon flakes with a fork when pulled apart.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pesto-salmon-with-wilted-greens/#wprm-recipe-54741-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Pesto-Salmon-with-Wilted-Greens-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "About 5-8 minutes before the salmon is done cooking, heat olive oil in a pan over medium heat. Once hot, add spinach and cook until soft and tender, about 3-5 minutes. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pesto-salmon-with-wilted-greens/#wprm-recipe-54741-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Pesto-Salmon-with-Wilted-Greens-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plate up the salmon and spinach, then sprinkle crumbled walnuts over the top of the dish. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pesto-salmon-with-wilted-greens/#wprm-recipe-54741-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
